  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0181",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1200
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "コスメブランドのクリスマスコフレの\r\nイメージモデルのオファーなんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えーと\r\n商品のコンセプトは……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『Good / Bad Christmas\r\n──いい子と悪い子のクリスマス』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ガーリーな『Good』と、クールな『Bad』\r\nふたつのテーマでアイテムを展開するというもので──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005013010050,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……ふふ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200501301/2005013010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──えっ\r\n何か面白いポイント、あったか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005013010060,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……や\r\n別に読み上げなくてもー",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501301/2005013010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005013010070,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "資料、私の手元にもあるんでー",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501301/2005013010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、ああ……！\r\n確かにそうだよな……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──それに、こういうメイク系のことは\r\n俺よりも摩美々の方が詳しいか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005013010080,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "あー、まぁ……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501301/2005013010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『クリスマスコフレ』──\r\nなんて難しい表現じゃなくてさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『クリスマス限定の化粧品セット』って書いてくれれば、\r\nわかりやすいのになぁ……はは……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 2005013010090,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……で\r\nプロデューサーはこの仕事が私にぴったりだと",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501301/2005013010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ\r\nコスメブランドのモデルっていうのもそうだし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "このコンセプト……『いい子と悪い子』なんて\r\nまさに摩美々って感じじゃないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005013010100,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "ふーん……\r\n……私、悪い子感しかないですケドねー",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501301/2005013010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうか？",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "こないだだってさ──",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "いや……！\r\nやっぱり──",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "でも……",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005013010110,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……ちょっとー\r\nなんの話、しようとしてますー？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501301/2005013010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　この前、レッスンまでの時間がない中\r\nちゃんと事務所を片付けていってくれた話をだな──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005013010120,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501301/2005013010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005013010130,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……はぁ\r\nそんなこと、覚えてなくていいのにー",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501301/2005013010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははっ、ちゃんと覚えてるよ\r\n片付けてもらって、すごく助かったからな……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005013010140,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "…………そうですかぁ\r\nじゃー今度は、片付けないでいくことにしますー",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501301/2005013010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005013010150,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501301/2005013010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "摩美々はさ、いつも真剣に\r\n仕事に取り組んでくれてるだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういうところを俺は知ってるし\r\nきっと、このブランドの人たちも──",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "摩美々のことをしっかり見て、\r\n声をかけてくれたんだと思うよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから、摩美々はいい子────",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005013010160,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501301/2005013010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……だし、悪い子でもあるかもしれないな！　うん！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──……いや、まぁ……\r\nそういうことにしておくか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005013010170,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……うわぁ、その気遣ってる感ー",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501301/2005013010170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005013010180,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "そういう感じ、わかっちゃって嫌なんでー\r\nやめてもらえませんかねー？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501301/2005013010180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "す、すまん\r\nそんなつもりはなかったんだが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005013010190,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……──なぁんて",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501301/2005013010190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……え？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005013010200,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "ふふー\r\nプロデューサー、今困りましたよねー？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501301/2005013010200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005013010210,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "じゃーどういう返事をすればよかったんだろうって\r\n思いましたよねー？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501301/2005013010210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、困ったというか──\r\n…………まぁ、少しはな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005013010220,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……ふふ\r\n困ってくれればいいんですよー",
